{
  "//": [
    "Dependency license policy for scripts/license-check.mjs and .github/workflows/license-check.yml (haxtheweb/issues#3262).",
    "allow: SPDX ids compatible with Apache-2.0. review: id prefixes a maintainer must look at (weak copyleft). Anything else fails, as do unknown licenses.",
    "exceptions: packages a maintainer has accepted, keyed by purl without version, with the exact license expressions accepted. The PR gate skips them; the weekly sweep fails if their license changes.",
    "The exceptions below are the packages already in yarn.lock when this policy was added (2026-11). They were listed, not reviewed: remove any that should not stay."
  ],
